<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Help Center | ZimPlug Music</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#050505;color:#fff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
a{color:inherit}
.zp-wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:90px 24px}
.zp-eyebrow{color:#d4af37;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px}
h1{font-size:clamp(45px,7vw,76px);line-height:.95;margin:18px 0}
.hero p{max-width:700px;color:#999;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}
.zp-section{border-top:1px solid #202020;padding:45px 0}
.zp-section h2{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 15px}
.zp-section>p,.zp-section li{color:#999;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px}
.zp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:28px}
.zp-card{padding:28px;background:#0b0b0b;border:1px solid #202020;border-radius:16px}
.zp-card:hover{border-color:#d4af37}
.zp-card h3{margin:0 0 12px}
.zp-card p{margin:0;color:#999;line-height:1.7;font-size:14px}
.zp-contact{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;background:#d4af37;color:#050505;padding:14px 22px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:700px){.zp-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.zp-wrap{padding:60px 20px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="zp-wrap">

<div class="hero">
<span class="zp-eyebrow">ZIMPLUG MUSIC</span>
<h1>How can we<br><span style="color:#d4af37">help?</span></h1>
<p>
Welcome to the ZimPlug Music Help Center. Find answers about
music downloads, accounts, artists, copyright, reporting problems,
and using the platform.
</p>
</div>

<section class="zp-section">
<h2>Getting Started</h2>
<p>
ZimPlug Music is a music discovery and download platform designed
to make it simple for listeners to discover music and download
available tracks directly to their devices.
</p>

<div class="zp-grid">
<div class="zp-card">
<h3>Finding music</h3>
<p>
Visit the Music page to browse available songs. You can explore
different genres, artists and featured releases.
</p>
</div>

<div class="zp-card">
<h3>Downloading music</h3>
<p>
When a song has a download option, select Download. Your browser
will begin downloading the available music file to your device.
</p>
</div>

<div class="zp-card">
<h3>Creating an account</h3>
<p>
An account can help you manage your ZimPlug experience and access
features made available to registered users.
</p>
</div>

<div class="zp-card">
<h3>Music information</h3>
<p>
Song pages may contain the artist name, title, genre, release
information and available download options.
</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="zp-section">
<h2>For Artists & Creators</h2>
<p>
Artists and authorized creators are responsible for ensuring that
music submitted to ZimPlug Music is content they have the legal
right to distribute.
</p>
<ul>
<li>Only submit music you own or are authorized to distribute.</li>
<li>Use accurate artist and song information.</li>
<li>Do not upload copyrighted material without permission.</li>
<li>Do not upload malware, deceptive files or misleading content.</li>
<li>Contact ZimPlug if information about your release needs correction.</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="zp-section">
<h2>Copyright & Takedowns</h2>
<p>
If you believe music available on ZimPlug Music infringes your
copyright, please use the Report page or contact the platform with
the relevant details. Valid copyright complaints can be reviewed
and appropriate action may be taken.
</p>
<a class="zp-contact" href="/legal">VIEW LEGAL & DMCA →</a>
</section>

<section class="zp-section">
<h2>Something isn't working?</h2>
<p>
If you discover a broken download, incorrect song information,
security issue, inappropriate content or another technical problem,
please report it so it can be reviewed.
</p>
<a class="zp-contact" href="/report">REPORT A PROBLEM →</a>
</section>

</main>
</body>
</html>